    "title": {
      "en": "Library Automation — Slim21 to KOHA Migration",
      "mr": "ग्रंथालय संगणकीकरण — Slim21 ते KOHA प्रणाली"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "The University Library is fully automated - University library purchased Slim 21 Special Library Management Software and as per guidelines/instructions from ICAR, New Delhi we have migrated all data from Slim21 to KOHA Library Management software and used for all operations (i.e. Acquisition, Cataloguing, Circulation, Serials & Web OPAC). All e-Resources are made available in the library for faculty members, scientists and students.",
      "mr": "विद्यापीठ ग्रंथालय पूर्णपणे संगणकीकृत आहे. पूर्वीच्या Slim 21 प्रणालीवरून ICAR, नवी दिल्ली यांच्या मार्गदर्शक तत्त्वांनुसार सर्व डेटा KOHA ओपन-सोर्स ग्रंथालय व्यवस्थापन प्रणालीत स्थलांतरित करण्यात आला आहे."
    },
